msgid "Krusader Mode"
msgstr "Krusader-Metood"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:521
msgid ""
"Both keys allow selecting files. To select more than one file, hold the Ctrl "
"key and click the left mouse button. Right-click menu is invoked using a "
"short click on the right mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Dateien laat sik mit beed Muusknööp utsöken. Wenn Du mehr as een Datei "
"utsöken wullt, holl de Strg-Tast daal un klick mit den linken Muusknoop. Dat "
"Rechtsklickmenü lett sik mit en kort Klick mit den rechten Muusknoop opropen."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:522
msgid "Konqueror Mode"
msgstr "Konqueror-Metood"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:522
msgid ""
"Pressing the left mouse button selects files - you can click and select "
"multiple files. Right-click menu is invoked using a short click on the right "
"mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Dat Drücken vun den linken Muusknoop söcht Dateien ut - Du kannst klicken un "
"mehr as een Datei utsöken. Dat Rechtsklickmenü lett sik mit en kort Klick "
"mit den rechten Muusknoop opropen."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:523
msgid "Total-Commander Mode"
msgstr "Total-Commander-Metood"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:523
msgid ""
"The left mouse button does not select, but sets the current file without "
"affecting the current selection. The right mouse button selects multiple "
"files and the right-click menu is invoked by pressing and holding the right "
"mouse button."
msgstr ""
"De linke Muusknoop söcht nich ut, man sett den Blinker, ahn dat de Köör sik "
"ännern deit. Mit den rechten Muusknoop laat sik mehr Dateien utsöken. Dat "
"Rechtsklickmenü lett sik opropen, wenn Een den rechten Muusknoop wat länger "
"daalhöllt."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:524
msgid "Ergonomic Mode"
msgstr "Ergonoomsch Bedrief"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:524
msgid ""
"The left mouse button does not select, but sets the current file without "
"affecting the current selection. The right mouse button invokes the context-"
"menu. You can select with Ctrl key and the left button."
msgstr ""
"De linke Muusknoop söcht nich ut, man sett den Blinker, ahn dat de Köör sik "
"ännern deit. Mit den rechten Muusknoop lett sik dat Rechtsklickmenü opropen. "
"Utsöken kannst Du mit de Strg-Tast un den linken Muusknoop."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:525
msgid "Custom Selection Mode"
msgstr "Egen Utsöökmetood"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:525
msgid "Design your own selection mode."
msgstr "Dien egen Utsöökmetood opstellen"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:537
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Enkelheiten"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:544
msgid "Double-click selects (classic)"
msgstr "Dubbelklick söcht ut (klass'sch)"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:544
msgid ""
"A single click on a file will select and focus, a double click opens the "
"file or steps into the directory."
msgstr ""
"En Enkelklick op en Datei sett den Blinker dor op un söcht ehr ut, en "
"Dubbelklick maakt de Datei oder den Orner op."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:545
msgid "Obey KDE's global selection policy"
msgstr "KDE sien globaal Utsöökregel bruken"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:545
msgid ""
"<p>Use KDE's global setting:</p><p><i>KDE System Settings -> Input Devices -"
"> Mouse</i></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE sien globale Instellen bruken:</p><p><i>KDE-Systeeminstellen -> "
"Ingaav-Reedschappen -> Muus</i></p>"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:556
msgid "Based on KDE's selection mode"
msgstr "Op KDE sien Utsöökmetood opbuut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:557
msgid "If checked, use a mode based on KDE's style."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, en Metood bruken, de op KDE sien Metood opbuut."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:559
msgid "Left mouse button selects"
msgstr "Linke Muusknoop söcht ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:560
msgid "If checked, left clicking an item will select it."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Linksklick en Indrag ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:562
msgid "Left mouse button preserves selection"
msgstr "Linke Muusknoop wohrt Köör"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:563
msgid ""
"If checked, left clicking an item will select it, but will not unselect "
"other, already selected items."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Linksklick en Indrag ut, man köört dor keen anner, al "
"utsöcht Indrääg bi af."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:565
msgid "Shift/Ctrl-Left mouse button selects"
msgstr "Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast un linke Muustast söcht ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:566
msgid ""
"If checked, Shift/Ctrl left clicking will select items.\n"
"Note: this is meaningless if 'Left Button Selects' is checked."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Indrääg bi daalhollen Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast mit en "
"Linksklick utsöcht.\n"
"Beacht: Dit deit nix, wenn \"Linke Muusknoop söcht ut\" anmaakt is."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:568
msgid "Right mouse button selects"
msgstr "Rechte Muusknoop söcht ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:569
msgid "If checked, right clicking an item will select it."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Rechtsklick en Indrag ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:571
msgid "Right mouse button preserves selection"
msgstr "Rechte Muusknoop wohrt Köör"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:572
msgid ""
"If checked, right clicking an item will select it, but will not unselect "
"other, already selected items."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Rechtsklick en Indrag ut, man köört dor keen anner, "
"al utsöcht Indrääg bi af."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:574
msgid "Shift/Ctrl-Right mouse button selects"
msgstr "Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast un rechte Muustast söcht ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:575
msgid ""
"If checked, Shift/Ctrl right clicking will select items.\n"
"Note: this is meaningless if 'Right Button Selects' is checked."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Indrääg bi daalhollen Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast mit en "
"Rechtsklick utsöcht.\n"
"Beacht: Dit deit nix, wenn \"Rechte Muusknoop söcht ut\" anmaakt is."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:577
msgid "Spacebar moves down"
msgstr "Freetast verschufft daal"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:578
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing the spacebar will select the current item and move "
"down.\n"
"Otherwise, current item is selected, but remains the current item."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, söcht de Freetast den aktuellen Indrag ut un verschufft den "
"Blinker na nerrn.\n"
"Anners söcht de Freetast den aktuellen Indrag ut, man de Blinker blifft, "
"woneem he is."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:580
msgid "Spacebar calculates disk space"
msgstr "Freetast reekt Plaatbruuk ut"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:581
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing the spacebar while the current item is a directory, "
"will (except from selecting the directory)\n"
"calculate space occupied of the directory (recursively)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt un de Blinker op en Orner steiht, reekt de Freetast, blang dat "
"de Orner utsöcht warrt, rekursiev den Platz op de Fastplaat ut, den de Orner "
"bruken deit."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:583
msgid "Insert moves down"
msgstr "Inföög-Tast verschufft na nerrn"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:584
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing Insert will select the current item, and move down to "
"the next item.\n"
"Otherwise, current item is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, söcht de Inföög-Tast den aktuellen Indrag ut un verschufft den "
"Blinker na nerrn\n"
"op den nakamen Indrag. Anners warrt de aktuelle Indrag nich ännert."

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:586
msgid "Right clicking pops context menu immediately"
msgstr "Rechtsklick röppt fuurts dat Rechtklickmenü op"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgpanel.cpp:587
msgid ""
"If checked, right clicking will result in an immediate showing of the "
"context menu.\n"
"Otherwise, user needs to click and hold the right mouse button for 500ms."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, wiest en Rechtsklick direktemang dat Rechtsklickmenü.\n"
"Anners mutt de Bruker den rechten Muusknoop en halvig Sekunn daalhollen."

