#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgstartup.cpp:103
msgid "Save last position, size and panel settings"
msgstr "Verleden Steed, Grött un Paneelinstellen sekern"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgstartup.cpp:104
msgid ""
"<p>At startup, the main window will resize itself to the size it was when "
"last shutdown. It will also appear in the same location of the screen, "
"having panels sorted and aligned as they were before.</p> <p>If this option "
"is disabled, you can use the menu <i>Window -> Save Position</i> option to "
"manually set the main window's size and position at startup.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bi't Starten warrt dat Hööftfinster wedder liek so groot, as dat bi't "
"verleden Utmaken weer. Dat dukt ok an de sülve Steed op, un ok de Paneels "
"sünd jüst so, as se weern.</p> <p>Is dit utmaakt, kannst Du mit <i>Finster -"
"> Steed sekern</i> de Grött un Steed vun't Hööftfinster bi't Opropen vun "
"Hand sekern.</p>"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgstartup.cpp:108
msgid "Update default panel settings"
msgstr "Standard-Paneelinstellen opfrischen"

#: krusader/Konfigurator/kgstartup.cpp:109
